# Project AI guidance

Follow the canonical developer rules in [`.AI/`](../../.AI/README.md).

1. Read [`.AI/README.md`](../../.AI/README.md).
2. Obey every file listed under **Active rules** (including [`.AI/git-workflow.md`](../../.AI/git-workflow.md) and [`.AI/commit-and-pr-style.md`](../../.AI/commit-and-pr-style.md)).

## Hard ban: commit/PR attribution

Never add `--trailer` to `git commit`. Never add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with`, or other tool branding to commits or PRs. See [`.AI/commit-and-pr-style.md`](../../.AI/commit-and-pr-style.md).

Do not duplicate rule bodies here — edit the `.AI/*.md` sources only.
